Map style and data (not part of this repository)
  The card fetches Home Assistant's own map style (/static/map/*.json) and
  vector tiles from your Home Assistant instance. The style is based on the
  VersaTiles "colorful" style (https://github.com/versatiles-org/node-versatiles-style)
  repainted by the Open Home Foundation; the tiles use the Shortbread schema and
  are built from OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available
  under the Open Database License (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
  The map shows the required attribution automatically.
